<<~ ahu slot=`#/purpose`>>

`uds-channel.ts` names the verb door's surface: every type, helper and seat a caller imports, re-exported from the modules under `uds-channel/`. The barrel every caller imports (`main.ts`, `open-node-vessel.ts`, `uds-session-door.ts`, the node package index and the suites). It holds no code of its own. The DAM checklist (<<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/mesh/uds-channel-dam`>>) carries its observations.

